activity Submit Benefit Request
activity Review Benefit Request
activity Approve
activity Reject
activity Notify Employee
activity Process Payment
activity Update Employee Record
activity Audit Benefit Process
activity Submit Appeal
activity Review Appeal
activity Approve Appeal
activity Reject Appeal
activity Notify Appeal Decision
activity Conduct Benefit Orientation
activity Evaluate Benefit Utilization
bind Submit Benefit Request: Request ID, Benefit Type, Employee ID
bind Review Benefit Request: Request ID, Request Status
bind Approve: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Reject: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Notify Employee: Request ID, Employee ID, Request Status
bind Process Payment: Request ID
bind Update Employee Record: Employee ID, Request ID
bind Audit Benefit Process: Request ID
bind Submit Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID, Appeal Status
bind Review Appeal: Request ID
bind Approve Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Reject Appeal: Request ID, Employee ID
bind Notify Appeal Decision: Employee ID
bind Conduct Benefit Orientation: Orientation ID
bind Evaluate Benefit Utilization: Utilization Rate
Request ID: integer between 1 and 10000
Benefit Type: Health Insurance, Retirement Plan, Paid Leave, Education Assistance
Employee ID: integer between 1 and 5000
Request Status: Approved, Rejected
Appeal Status: Pending
Utilization Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Orientation ID: integer between 1 and 500
Init[Submit Benefit Request] | |
End[Notify Employee] | |
Existence[Review Benefit Request] | |
Existence[Conduct Benefit Orientation] | |
Existence[Evaluate Benefit Utilization] | |
Exactly2[Notify Employee] | |
Response[Approve, Notify Employee] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Reject, Notify Employee] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Precedence[Approve, Review Benefit Request] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND T.Request Status is Approved |
Precedence[Reject, Review Benefit Request] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND T.Request Status is Rejected |
Response[Approve, Process Payment] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,7,d
Response[Approve, Update Employee Record] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID AND A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,5,d
Response[Process Payment, Audit Benefit Process] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,30,d
Response[Submit Appeal, Review Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |0,5,d
Response[Review Appeal, Approve Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Response[Review Appeal, Reject Appeal] | |A.Request ID == T.Request ID |
Response[Approve Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] | |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d
Response[Reject Appeal, Notify Appeal Decision] | |A.Employee ID == T.Employee ID |0,2,d